{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobK1rxvs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津ジャーン！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！\n小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いよいよ明後日\nアンダーライブが始まります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私にとっては\n初めてのアンダーライブ！\n緊張もしているのですが\nどんなライブになるのか\nとてもワクワクしています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "42枚目シングルアンダー楽曲\n「フォルテシモ」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛らしい曲調と歌詞の中に\nひたすら前に突き進む力強さを秘めた\nとっても素敵な楽曲です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVは本当の廃工場で撮ったのだけれど\n秘密基地みたいでワクワクしちゃった🏭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobrXrVzU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "トランシーバーとか作戦会議とか\n小さい頃の憧れがぎゅっとつまった\nMVでとっても嬉しかったの！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の好きなポイントは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1:23のみんながパッと前を向く瞬間と"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1:54〜のマイクを持って歌っているシーン！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんながパッと前を向くときに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハッ😳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "っていう顔をしているから見て欲しいの！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あやちゃんの近くにワーって寄って行って\nわちゃわちゃしているところからの\nパッと前を向くギャップが\n大好きで\n何回も繰り返し見ています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マイクを持って歌うシーンは\nみんなでずっと飛び跳ねていて\nとっても楽しかったの！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "顔を見合わせるたびに\n全員が笑顔で歌っていて\n元気をたくさんもらったよ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "歌のパワーを実際に感じることができて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "思い出に残る撮影でした📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobwQOpZF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↓「フォルテシモ」MUSIC VIDEO"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/KZNDIhxGwoQ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんのお気に入りポイントも\nぜひ教えてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "＋αの\nおすすめポイント！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回衣装が全員違うのです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は赤いTシャツの下に\n青いワンピースを着て\nレイヤードしているの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての組み合わせだったけれど\nとっても可愛かったの！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph